                                    hőm&eacute;rs&eacute;klet-&eacute;rz&eacute;kelő (FOLLOW ME).</p></li></ul><p><strong>SZ&Eacute;LES HŐM&Eacute;RS&Eacute;KLETTARTOM&Aacute;NY</strong></p><ul><li><p>A modern technol&oacute;gia &eacute;s az &uacute;j R32 hűtők&ouml;zeg
