                                    n&eacute;lk&uuml;li t&aacute;vir&aacute;ny&iacute;t&oacute;ba van
                                    &eacute;p&iacute;tve.</p></li></ul><p><em>Intelligens leolvaszt&aacute;s:</em>&nbsp;Amennyiben a hőm&eacute;rs&eacute;klet -5&deg;C
